    "description": "What: on berlin a physical 'Blue Company' (CompanyDefend at (1000,200), facing north) over ONE stochastic 'Blue Stochastic Squad' (from the TKB composite) standing on that position; a stochastic 'Red Stochastic Squad' 500 m north ATTACKS it (StochasticUnitAttack on (1000,200)) and walks in. Judge: (1) the squad is ordered Defend by KIND and holds its position (it never breaks contact, never leaves); (2) it does NOT fire while the enemy is beyond its riflemen's reach (the M4's 300 m, the killer-victim table's MaxRange) - it has seen it long before; (3) it fires within seconds of the enemy coming inside 300 m (Red's centre past y 500) and the fire tells: a Red slot goes down. Fail: no fire after the enemy closes (finding F-14), fire before it is in reach, or the defender leaving its position. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-defend-fires"
